abstract: >-
  Public-facing repository for the L4 reality-bound layer: notes, protocol
  materials, and posts that ground AI safety claims in physical constraints,
  access, time, irreversibility, witness traceability, and freeze discipline.
  It serves as the L4 operational layer rather than the canonical normative
  home of the Arbitration / Review Layer.
